  "description": "The \"dream railway paradise entertainment\" story is set in a parallel world where Japan did not privatize its national railways. Naohito Takayama is an ordinary high school boy who dreams of a comfortable future working for the top-rated Japanese National Railways. He is assigned as a trainee in the Railways Security Force full of odd characters such as Sakurai, a troublemaker who hates men. On top of that, an extremist group called \"RJ\" plots to privatize the Japanese National Railways.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Anime News Network)",
